ASCII                   5 cells,  5 bytes
accented (Latin-1)      5 cells,  6 bytes
CJK (wide)              4 cells,  6 bytes
emoji (wide)            2 cells,  4 bytes
e + combining acute     1 cells,  3 bytes
fullwidth A             2 cells,  3 bytes
on a 5 column screen: ab世
fitBytes(6 cells) = 8, fitBytes(3) = 2
